      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Numel’s been frozen into a solid block of ice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00790020004E0075006D0065006C201900730020006200650065006E002000660072006F007A0065006E00200069006E0074006F0020006100200073006F006C0069006400200062006C006F0063006B0020006F00660020006900630065002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We were taking a walk in the wild zone...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006500200077006500720065002000740061006B0069006E006700200061002000770061006C006B00200069006E0020007400680065002000770069006C00640020007A006F006E0065002E002E002E00100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "when suddenly we got caught in the middle of\na bunch of wild Pokémon fighting each other!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nNumel got hit with, like, 10 Ice Beams!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Numel’s a Fire type, but it’s not thawing out at all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0075006D0065006C20190073002000610020004600690072006500200074007900700065002C0020006200750074002000690074201900730020006E006F0074002000740068006100770069006E00670020006F0075007400200061007400200061006C006C002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not even an Ice Heal did the trick. The only other\noption is to use a superhot Fire-type move!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So please, you’ve got to help me!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThaw Numel out by hitting it with a superhot Fire-\ntype move!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think the ice will melt if you hit it with a really\npowerful Fire-type move, such as Flamethrower.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’m so worried about Numel... I know it’s a Fire\ntype itself, but it might catch a cold!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 197
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That move won’t work! Only a blisteringly hot Fire-\ntype move can melt that ice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That worked—all the ice is melted! Oh, thank you\nso much!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007400200077006F0072006B0065006420140061006C006C002000740068006500200069006300650020006900730020006D0065006C00740065006400210020004F0068002C0020007400680061006E006B00200079006F0075000A0073006F0020006D007500630068002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you OK, Numel?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F00750020004F004B002C0020004E0075006D0065006C003F002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait... Were you snacking on Berries the whole\ntime you were frozen?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002E002E002E0020005700650072006500200079006F007500200073006E00610063006B0069006E00670020006F006E002000420065007200720069006500730020007400680065002000770068006F006C0065000A00740069006D006500200079006F007500200077006500720065002000660072006F007A0065006E003F002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mrph.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007200700068002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess that’s fitting... Numel is the Numb\nPokémon, after all.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
